# Maintained fork context

This is **shomanjk/sms-backup-plus**, an unofficial maintained fork.

- Base: **jberkel/sms-backup-plus** `master` (includes RCS/group-thread fixes).
- Ported: **henrichg** Android 7+ backup **trigger/receiver** fixes (BACKUP intent, exported receivers, runtime SMS registration, incoming scheduler).
- Remotes: `origin` = this fork, `upstream` = jberkel, `henrichg` = henrichg.
- Version: `0.2.5` / `applicationId` `com.zegoggles.smssync` / `minSdk` 24 / `compileSdk` 36 / `targetSdk` 35.
- Release notes: [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) (live); [CHANGES](CHANGES) is upstream archive only.
- Auto backup: WorkManager on `phase-2-workmanager` (see ROADMAP); maintainer device checks passed. Do **not** claim every OEM/Doze combination is verified.
- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for full agent guidance.

## Do

- Prefer Android 14/15 OEM/Doze hardening and device verification over new features.
- Keep changes small; preserve jberkel RCS/threading behavior.
- Keep fork-status copy accurate in README (unofficial maintained fork; no “not ready for daily use” unless that changes).
- On user-visible releases or version bumps: update or **suggest** updating
  Welcome / What's new (`ui_dialog_welcome_*`, `ui_dialog_whats_new_*`) and
  menu About (`about.html`), plus `CHANGELOG.md`. See AGENTS.md checklist.

## Don't

- Commit keystores, `keystore.properties`, `local.properties`, `.env`, APKs, or MCP secrets.
- Claim auto-backup is proven on every OEM/Doze setup (Phase 3 still open).
- Change `applicationId` or merge speculative upstream PRs unless the user asks.
- Edit the sibling henrichg-only clone (`../sms-backup-plus`) by mistake.
